# game/custom/mods/Auction House/auction_scene.rpy:49
translate chinese_simplified auction_scene_a2c2abc7:

    # gio "Welcome, welcome! The GRAND auction only happens once a month — finest girls and rarest treasures in all of Zan! Please, take a seat, the bidding is about to start."
    gio "欢迎，欢迎！大拍卖每月只有一次——整个 Zan 最出色的姑娘、最罕见的珍宝！请入座，竞拍马上开始。"

# game/custom/mods/Auction House/auction_scene.rpy:51
translate chinese_simplified auction_scene_18e5de1f:

    # gio "Ah, my favorite customer! Welcome to the weekly auction — girls, trinkets, everything must go. Bid, or list your own goods for a small fee."
    gio "啊，我最喜欢的贵客！欢迎参加每周拍卖会——姑娘、小玩意儿，样样清仓。可以出价竞拍，也可以付点手续费挂牌您自己的商品。"

# game/custom/mods/Auction House/auction_scene.rpy:89
translate chinese_simplified auction_bidding_loop_6fd44c1d:

    # gio "Going once... going twice... SOLD! [auction_tmp_name] goes to you. Always a pleasure doing business."
    gio "第一次……第二次……成交！[auction_tmp_name] 归您了。和您做生意总是这么愉快。"

# game/custom/mods/Auction House/auction_scene.rpy:133
translate chinese_simplified auction_bidding_loop_d8bd16c1:

    # gio "[auction_tmp_name], listed! The fee's non-refundable, but the proceeds are all yours if it sells."
    gio "[auction_tmp_name] 已挂牌！手续费不退，但要是成交，货款全归您。"

# game/custom/mods/Auction House/auction_scene.rpy:162
translate chinese_simplified auction_scene_end_2b80d9cb:

    # gio "That's a wrap for the grand auction! Same time next month — bring more gold, heh heh heh."
    gio "本月大拍卖到此结束！下个月同一时间——多带些金币来，嘿嘿嘿。"

# game/custom/mods/Auction House/auction_scene.rpy:164
translate chinese_simplified auction_scene_end_08798d1b:

    # gio "That's all for this week! The next grand auction is on the first sale of the month — don't miss it."
    gio "本周的拍卖就到这里！下一场大拍卖在本月首场拍卖日——千万别错过。"
